description=Watch videos in Project Zomboid! Drop video files into your Zomboid/PZVP/ folder, press INSERT in-game, pick a video and quality, and enjoy. Play, pause, seek (click the bar, or SPACE / arrow keys while hovering), aspect-ratio-correct display in a resizable window. Requires ffmpeg on your system and the Video Framebuffer (PZFB) mod with its one-time install step; PZFB 1.8.0 recommended (v1.1.0 plays nicely alongside PZEMU/PZDOOM). Tested on Linux — Windows feedback welcome!
